  "description": "Coast Guard Chief Petty Officer Stephen Kelly, Petty Officer 1st Class DeWayne Visser and Petty Officers 3rd Class Eric Gordon and Gavin Kershaw pilot 16-foot flood punt boats in search of distressed residents in Friendswood, Texas, Aug. 29, 2017. The flood punt team from Marine Safety Unit Paducah, Kentucky, reported to the greater Houston area on Aug. 25 and have rescued over 850 people. (U.S. Coast Guard video by Petty Officer 3rd Class Corinne Zilnicki/Released)",
